{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10641030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10641030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1064103001:1":{"text":"배고프다... 다행히 저녁에 남겨둔 빵이 있었네.","source_cn":"好饿……幸好晚餐时剩下了一些面包。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EBE7DF316D3178F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064103002:1":{"text":"달이 참 밝구나... 그 사건만 없었다면 평온한 밤이 되었을 텐데...","source_cn":"月色多么皎洁啊……如果没有发生那桩惨案，本该是宁静的一夜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF85CE4493D61EA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064103003:1":{"text":"끼익...","source_cn":"咔吱——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38B6C7D979833F3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064103004:1":{"text":"...이상하다. 어디서 나는 소리지?","source_cn":"……奇怪，哪里来的声音？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x089B07C3B7B5F758","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:8::0":{"text":"수납장","source_cn":"橱柜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FEF9F894DC6E389","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064103005:1":{"text":"아무래도 저 찬장 안에서 나는 것 같아. 혹시 쥐가 있나?!","source_cn":"好像是从那只橱柜里传出来的。难道有老鼠在偷吃？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD71875B6B28DB87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064103006:1":{"text":"세상에! 얼른 쫓아내야겠어!","source_cn":"这可不行！我得把它们赶走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x239749EDFA9CBCF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1064103007:1":{"text":"아이다는 발소리를 죽이고 찬장에 다가가, 문을 힘껏 열어젖혔다","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EE3A725434FECB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1064103008:1":{"text":"하지만 그 안에 숨어 있던 것은 쥐가 아니라 칼을 들고 있는 남자였다!","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F846ADBAEDAEB61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064103009:1":{"text":"누, 누구세요?!","source_cn":"你……你是谁？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA315D60602DDC975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064103010:0":{"text":"젠장...","source_cn":"可恶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F874984482DC30F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064103011:0":{"text":"...죽어라!","source_cn":"——去死吧！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BD802988910ED97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064103012:0":{"text":"꺄악! 사, 살려주세요!","source_cn":"啊——！救、救命啊——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCA90DF0831B0E3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064103013:0":{"text":"도망칠 생각 마! 오늘이 바로 네...","source_cn":"别想跑！今天就是你的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBC41111445F3903","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:27:1064103014:0":{"text":"신성한 빛이 하늘에서 내려와 악당의 말을 끝내 버렸다","source_cn":"一道神光从天而降，终结了恶徒的话语","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0314DCE59A647138","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:28:1064103015:1":{"text":"떨리는 눈꺼풀을 들어 올린 아이다는, 눈앞에 펼쳐진 광경을 또렷이 목격했다...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95F8C7D0D5D4EAB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:29:1064103016:1":{"text":"악당은 백금빛 창에 꿰뚫려 숨을 거두었고","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA29AD611B563D01A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:30:1064103017:1":{"text":"곧 그 창은 신성한 기운이 느껴지는 사람으로 변했다","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EF52D53E436FBB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064103018:1":{"text":"심판은 이미 내려졌다.","source_cn":"裁决已至。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46A888042F5B8C60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064103019:1":{"text":"다, 당신은...","source_cn":"您、您是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5831AC0C12DCAFAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064103020:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064103021:1":{"text":"무슨 일이... 오, 세상에...","source_cn":"发生了什——噢，天哪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF884EB5C08AAE4B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064103022:1":{"text":"듀, 듀라 님이시여... 아탈리아 님!","source_cn":"艾雅在上……是、是阿塔利娅大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76BE8CCF77925DBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064103023:1":{"text":"저, 정말 아탈리아 님이신가요? 그 “징벌의 검”...","source_cn":"真、真的是阿塔利娅大人，传说中的天罚之刃……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x759B4472F1CAC833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064103024:1":{"text":"악인은 이미 제거되었다.","source_cn":"恶徒已经清除。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21F5CB7462479D7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064103025:1":{"text":"이 남자 말씀이신가요?","source_cn":"您是说这个男人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE5EDE4BBDBF5C58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064103026:1":{"text":"네! 루이자 수녀님! 저 남자가 계속 찬장 안에 숨어 있다가, 제게 들키자 해치려 했어요!","source_cn":"是的！路易莎修女，他一直躲在橱柜里，被我发现后还想伤害我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A634AA10931E7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064103027:1":{"text":"듀라 님이시여... 이 사람은 빈센조 아닌가요?!","source_cn":"艾雅在上……这不是文森佐吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81361E56AB70A3C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064103028:1":{"text":"빈센조요? 아는 사람인가요?","source_cn":"文森佐？您认识他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5686B0E10B7E8331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064103029:1":{"text":"10년 전, 성당은 많은 전쟁 난민을 받아들였지요. 빈센조도 그중 하나였습니다. 그때도 이 찬장에 숨어 있었는데...","source_cn":"十年前，教堂曾收留过很多战争难民，文森佐就是其中之一。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AA5A6C23FA397F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064103030:1":{"text":"이 자는 전쟁 난민이 아니다. 악행을 일삼는 블랙골드 상회의 잔당이지.","source_cn":"他不是战争难民，他是黑金商会的残党，四处为非作歹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92E94BD7987B309E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064103031:0":{"text":"설마 블랙골드 상회에 가담했을 줄은...","source_cn":"没想到，他竟然加入了黑金商会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D5BE45A0CEC965A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064103032:0":{"text":"아탈리아 님, 외람되지만... 이 사람이 악행을 많이 저질렀나요?","source_cn":"阿塔利娅大人，请宽恕我的冒昧询问。他做了很多坏事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC81DF42CE4C76D20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064103033:0":{"text":"그래. 블랙골드 상회원들은 다 그렇다.","source_cn":"是。黑金商会成员皆是如此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAC80B225D85D61C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064103034:1":{"text":"다른 공범들도 이미 심판했다. 하지만 감히 성당에 숨어들어 가호의 땅을 더럽히다니! 용서할 수 없어!","source_cn":"其余同党都已被我裁决。而他，竟敢躲藏于教堂，玷污女神庇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF95CAA5B015BBC51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064103035:1":{"text":"그렇다면 레로를 살해한 것도 이 사람인가요?","source_cn":"那么，杀害列罗的凶手，有没有可能也是他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD22900452DA7977F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064103036:1":{"text":"살해?","source_cn":"杀害他人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1777775CCF874BD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064103037:1":{"text":"네. 엔사 마을에서 일어난 일입니다...","source_cn":"是，恩莎村发生了一桩惨案……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF99C69E07308A16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu